# Protected Architecture Rules

Do not:
- modify tsconfig.json unless explicitly requested
- install dependencies automatically
- change eslint/prettier configs automatically
- restructure modules automatically
- create new architectural patterns
- replace Supabase architecture
- introduce ORMs
- generate mock implementations unless requested
- change folder structure without permission
- modify Prisma architecture or repositories without explicit request
- change Supabase role (Auth/Storage separation)
- modify RequestContext flow
- introduce new persistence patterns
